        "description": "Several security issues were discovered in the Linux kernel. An attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system. This update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:   - Cryptographic API;   - SPI subsystem;   - SMB network file system;   - io_uring subsystem; (CVE-2025-38561, CVE-2025-39698, CVE-2025-40019, CVE-2025-68746)",
